What is CO2 RF Metal Laser?
CO2 RF Metal Lasers represent a major advancement in industrial laser technology, utilizing radio frequency (RF) excitation within fully metalized structures to achieve superior performance. Unlike traditional glass tube CO2 lasers, these systems offer three times finer beam quality along with compact designs, maintenance-free operation, and exceptional power stability. With service lives exceeding 20,000 hours and plug efficiency of 10-12%, they provide the most cost-effective per-watt output among industrial lasers.
